Lemma ex_ff_nums : forall LF m lo shi ff fp TL T SP TP n k,
  ex_side H LF m lo shi ff fp TL T SP TP n k ->
  fresh_frame H LF 1 ff fp /\ aapp ff 128
  /\ 6848512 <= ff /\ ff + 128 <= aceil /\ ff mod 8 = 0 /\ 6815744 <= fp /\ fp + 1 <= ff
  /\ 2148302336 <= Z.shiftr ff 3 + 2147450880 /\ Z.shiftr ff 3 + 2147450880 + 16 <= 17594333495296
  /\ (ff + 128 <= 2147446784 \/ 17594333495296 <= ff)
  /\ (fp + 1 <= 2147446784 \/ 17594333495296 <= fp).
Proof.
  intros LF m lo shi ff fp TL T SP TP n k (RF & _).
  pose proof (fresh_of_RFS _ HH _ _ _ _ _ RF) as FF.
  pose proof (ff_facts _ _ _ _ _ FF) as (_ & _ & _ & _ & F1 & F2 & F3 & _ & F4 & F5 & F6 & F7 & F8 & F9 & F10 & F11 & F12 & APF & APP1 & SHFF & SF1 & SF2 & SF3 & NSB).
  fs_nums_in F2. fs_nums_in APF. fs_nums_in SF2.
  pose proof (aapp_not_shadowland _ _ APF) as NSF. pose proof (aapp_not_shadowland _ _ APP1) as NSP.
  unfold AIMG_TOP, AFS_HDR, AFS_FLAGS, AHI_LO, ALOWSH_LO in *. rewrite <- SHFF in SF1, SF2.
  repeat (split; [first [assumption | lia]|]). exact NSP.
Qed.

